9
00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:25.200
But as time has gone on, and as everyone has competed on models, as we've talked about many times on the show, I think it's pretty obvious that it is very hard to get the same sort of return on capital invested in model development as it is in capital invested on compute infrastructure and being model agnostic.

10
00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:31.280
What Google has is probably one of the greatest install enterprise bases in the world for compute.

11
00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:34.400
So they have the most enterprise customers, they have the most consumers.

12
00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:40.000
