37
00:04:49.440 --> 00:05:00.480
And the reason nobody talks about it is because the the Atlanta Fed has 30 different versions of the Taylor rule, and they do that on purpose because if you have one version, people say, Oh, you're using the wrong version.

38
00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.520
So the Atlanta Fed has 30 different versions.

39
00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:07.760
